{"2478900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "hislittlecuzin's Airsoft Pew Pew", "steam_appid": 2478900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This multiplayer First Person Shooter recreates the sport of Airsoft with an emphasis on casual open play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/4748ad77d576bdf1f86f96563734acaf.avif?t=1784265394\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras_big/4748ad77d576bdf1f86f96563734acaf.avif?t=1784265394 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features include:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>SPLIT SCREEN EVEN WITH ONLINE PLAY!! ON PC??? YES!!! IT'S NOT ILLEGAL!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Licensed Airsoft Equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Built in Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Server Side Rollback, and Client Side Prediction for a smooth online gaming experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom Lobbies for a catered experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No competitive nor ranked play! Just casual fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/3e568f6d93899326221b52c45b899ed9.avif?t=1784265394\" width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/00870b6cf3699d4d8365da4f54e512d7.avif?t=1784265394\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras_big/00870b6cf3699d4d8365da4f54e512d7.avif?t=1784265394 width=800 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\